{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"items\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S01-1\",\n      \"verdict\": \"保留\",\n      \"note\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S01-2\",\n      \"verdict\": \"保留\",\n      \"note\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S01-B1-p3\",\n      \"verdict\": \"保留\",\n      \"note\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S01-B3-p3\",\n      \"verdict\": \"部分\",\n      \"note\": \"保留了愤怒与想念之间难以辨认的状态，但漏掉了遗憾这一可能情绪，也没有表达这种失落尚未找到对象、尚未找到语言。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S02-3\",\n      \"verdict\": \"保留\",\n      \"note\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S02-2\",\n      \"verdict\": \"保留\",\n      \"note\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S02-B1-p4\",\n      \"verdict\": \"保留\",\n      \"note\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S02-B4-p3\",\n      \"verdict\": \"部分\",\n      \"note\": \"保留了越反复说没事、越暴露在意的核心意思，但省略了三次自我说服的递进：第一次相信，第二次努力相信，第三次连重复本身都暴露了真实感受。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S03-2\",\n      \"verdict\": \"保留\",\n      \"note\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S03-B2-p4\",\n      \"verdict\": \"部分\",\n      \"note\": \"保留了温柔、心颤以及越怀念越感到距离的意思，但弱化了另一半：这种怀念同时具有刺痛感，甚至让人绝望。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S04-2\",\n      \"verdict\": \"保留\",\n      \"note\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S04-B2-p2\",\n      \"verdict\": \"部分\",\n      \"note\": \"保留了美好回忆也会刺痛的意思，但漏掉了关键因果：不是记忆变坏，而是记忆太美好，过去已经无法原样回来。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S05-2\",\n      \"verdict\": \"保留\",\n      \"note\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S05-B5-p3\",\n      \"verdict\": \"部分\",\n      \"note\": \"保留了不是想通、而是抵抗得累了的核心意思，但漏掉了声音稀疏下来以及心里未必真正平静这一层。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S06-1\",\n      \"verdict\": \"保留\",\n      \"note\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S06-2\",\n      \"verdict\": \"保留\",\n      \"note\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S06-3\",\n      \"verdict\": \"保留\",\n      \"note\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S06-B2-p3\",\n      \"verdict\": \"保留\",\n      \"note\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S07-3\",\n      \"verdict\": \"保留\",\n      \"note\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S07-1\",\n      \"verdict\": \"部分\",\n      \"note\": \"保留了以后遇到困难可能只能独自承担、担心自己撑不住的意思，但原文是要是仍然只能一个人扛的假设性担忧，短版的还得一个人扛把这种可能性说得更确定。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S07-B1-p2\",\n      \"verdict\": \"保留\",\n      \"note\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S08-2\",\n      \"verdict\": \"保留\",\n      \"note\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S08-B3-p2\",\n      \"verdict\": \"保留\",\n      \"note\": \"胸口吸气与短暂喘息的意思保留了；短版另用安静刚认出就退去、还没来得及安顿补足了这不是整体重新安顿的意思。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S08-B2-p1\",\n      \"verdict\": \"保留\",\n      \"note\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S09-1\",\n      \"verdict\": \"保留\",\n      \"note\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S09-B2-p2\",\n      \"verdict\": \"保留\",\n      \"note\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S10-2\",\n      \"verdict\": \"保留\",\n      \"note\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S10-1\",\n      \"verdict\": \"保留\",\n      \"note\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S10-B3-p2\",\n      \"verdict\": \"保留\",\n      \"note\": \"走了这么久还是没答案保留了历经许多仍无答案的意思，累得不想再讲一遍也补足了疲惫感。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S10-B1-p5\",\n      \"verdict\": \"保留\",\n      \"note\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S11-3\",\n      \"verdict\": \"保留\",\n      \"note\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S11-4\",\n      \"verdict\": \"保留\",\n      \"note\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S11-B3-p1\",\n      \"verdict\": \"保留\",\n      \"note\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S11-B2-p2\",\n      \"verdict\": \"保留\",\n      \"note\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S12-2\",\n      \"verdict\": \"保留\",\n      \"note\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S12-B1-p1\",\n      \"verdict\": \"保留\",\n      \"note\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S13-4\",\n      \"verdict\": \"保留\",\n      \"note\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S13-2\",\n      \"verdict\": \"保留\",\n      \"note\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S13-B1-p3\",\n      \"verdict\": \"保留\",\n      \"note\": \"\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"added\": [\n    {\n      \"text\": \"夜色里并肩低语\",\n      \"why\": \"原文是两只手仿佛夜色里的两个影子，彼此低声说话，没有明确交代并肩这一具体空间关系。这是轻微增加的画面细节。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"我还得一个人扛\",\n      \"why\": \"原文表达的是如果以后仍然只能独自承担的担忧，并没有确定未来必然如此。短版用还得把假设性担忧强化成了较确定的未来处境。\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"summary\": \"39项中没有整项丢失，绝大多数核心意思得到保留，部分主要集中在情绪递进、因果关系和心理层次的压缩。新增内容主要是并肩这一具体画面，以及把独自承担的可能性说得更确定；终于下定决心则是把原文已有的一种可选听法确定化，并非全新内容。没有发现明显把珠子中的比喻直接改写成线里真实发生的事件。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "f880efc8-e54f-455a-a0a5-c0df39fe1047", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261105T102723668741Z", "elapsed_seconds": 112.657, "completed_utc": "2026-11-05T10:29:16.338476+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "8df02ed0128a74c1bb9c0a649199b5500b5db45600a517e6ad211d1d6a74e4fb", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8